Package: Maple
Title: Multi-resolution Automated Partitioning via Leiden Exploration
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Gabriele", "Dolfi",
    email = "gabriele.dolfi@phd.unipd.it",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0005-1337-3468"))
Description: Maple identifies a multi-resolution clustering of single cells
    by building a stability-weighted partition tree across a Leiden resolution
    grid and pruning it to find the optimal simultaneous partition at multiple
    granularity levels.
